                  {
                    "value": "How to read this page",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "12pt",
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "color": "#26407A"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Each side is one group of patients. Pick a measure, then tick the filters for that group. You can tick more than one value. Nothing ticked means all admissions aged 60+.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "11pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "The chart shows both sides by year. When the two sides use different measures, the two axes have different units. Cost here leaves out blood tests and the same-day discount.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "11pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "The groups are small and deaths are few, so a gap between the two sides is not a finding: read the 95% confidence interval. Two lines that move together do not show a cause. Mock data; years run to 2027.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "11pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        }
